{"identifiers": {"librarything": ["58012"], "goodreads": ["1508227"]}, "weight": "12 ounces", "covers": [992638], "lc_classifications": ["PQ2682.A725 H63 1999"], "source_records": ["marc:marc_loc_2016/BooksAll.2016.part28.utf8:96018316:548", "marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/ab.bib.11.20150123.full.mrc:875911085:571", "marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_024.bib.mrc:290415040:1660"], "title": "L'Homme à l'envers", "languages": [{"key": "/languages/fre"}], "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "physical_dimensions": "7.3 x 5 x 0.7 inches", "publishers": ["Viviane Hamy"], "physical_format": "Paperback", "key": "/books/OL9005054M", "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL6926243A"}], "lccn": ["99224859"], "number_of_pages": 300, "isbn_13": ["9782878581072"], "isbn_10": ["2878581075"], "publish_date": "March 18, 1999", "works": [{"key": "/works/OL2497610W"}], "oclc_numbers": ["41505648"], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "Le mardi, il y eut quatre brebis égorgées à Ventebrune, dans les Alpes. Et le jeudi, neuf à Pierrefort. Un loup solitaire ? Roué, cruel, avec son cul bas sur ses pattes grises ? La Bête du Mercantour. Mais au village de Saint-Victor-du-Mont, tous n'y croient pas, à la Bête. Ce n'est pas une Bête. C'est un homme. Un loup-garou. À Paris, devant son écran, le commissaire Adamsberg guette les nouvelles du Mercantour."}, "latest_revision": 10, "revision": 10, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2008-04-30T09:38:13.731961"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-12-09T06:45:56.654905"}}